### Auth Tests Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/v1

### ============================================
### HAPPY PATH TESTS
### ============================================

### 1. Register - Create New User
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### 2. Register - Different User for Testing
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anotheruser@example.com",
  "password": "AnotherPassword456!"
}

### 3. Login - Get Access Token
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Response will have:
### {
###   "message": "Login successful.",
###   "accessToken": "eyJ...",
###   "refreshToken": "eyJ...",
###   "user": {...}
### }

### Store the accessToken and refreshToken for next tests

### ============================================
### PROTECTED ENDPOINTS - Use Token in Header
### ============================================

### 4. Get Current User (Me)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}

### 5. Refresh Token - Get New Access Token
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{refreshToken}"
}

### 6. Change Password
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "TestPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword789!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewPassword789!"
}

### 7. Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### VALIDATION TESTS - Invalid Input
### ============================================

### 8. Register - Invalid Email
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request

### 9. Register - Password Too Short
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "short"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request (password must be at least 8 chars)

### 10. Register - Empty Password
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser2@example.com",
  "password": ""
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request

### 11. Register - Missing Email
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request

### 12. Register - Duplicate Email
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "AnotherPassword123!"
}

### Expected: 409 Conflict (Email already registered)

### 13. Login - Wrong Password
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 14. Login - User Not Found
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### ============================================
### AUTHORIZATION TESTS
### ============================================

### 15. Get Me - Without Token
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/me

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 16. Get Me - Invalid Token
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 17. Get Me - Expired Token
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwiZW1haWwiOiJ0ZXN0QGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNTE2MjM5MDIyfQ.SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36POk6yJV_adQssw5c

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 18. Change Password - Without Token
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "TestPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword789!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewPassword789!"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### ============================================
### ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### 19. Change Password - Wrong Current Password
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "WrongPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword789!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewPassword789!"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 20. Change Password - New Password Same as Current
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "TestPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "TestPassword123!",
  "confirmPassword": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request

### ============================================
### RESPONSE FORMAT VERIFICATION
### ============================================

### All endpoints should return consistent response format:
### Success: { "message": "...", "data": {...} or "accessToken": "..." }
### Error: { "statusCode": 4xx|5xx, "message": "...", "error": "..." }

### Status Codes Expected:
### - 200: Success GET/PATCH
### - 201: Success POST (register)
### - 400: Bad Request (validation)
### - 401: Unauthorized (auth failed or no token)
### - 409: Conflict (duplicate email)
### - 500: Server Error
